      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The \"impact\" approach is a necessary evil, but it requires careful implementation to avoid over-moderation. To mitigate this, platforms can use AI-powered content analysis tools to identify potential harm, and have human moderators review and validate those findings. This way, you can strike a balance between protecting users from harm and preserving free speech.",
      "source": "target",
